<title>UK: Deutsche sets $1.3 bln exchangeable bond.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets $1.3 bln exchangeable bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE FINANCE NETHERLANDS</p>
<p> AMT    $1.3 BLN	COUPON     ZERO	MATURITY  **     2017</p>
<p> TYPE   EXCHANGEABLE  ISS PRICE  ***	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> IND PREM   13 - 18 PCT</p>
<p> NOTES  **CALLABLE AFTER 5 YEARS, PUT AFTER 5, 10 AND 15 YEARS</p>
<p>	    YIELD TO MATURITY 4.25 - 4.75 PCT</p>
<p>	    EXCHANGEBLE INT ORDINARY SHARES OF DAIMLER BENZ AG</p>
<p>	 ***ISSUED AT A DISCOUNT TO PAR (39.11 - 43.12 PCT)</p>
</text>
